        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 785AR, Traditional Lever with Arched Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPerfect for traditional homes, the Fluted Lever With Arched Rose is classic styled hardware at its best. Made by <a href=\"/collections/omnia\">Omnia Industries</a>, the 785AR Leverset is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage, and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\" thick doors. The beauty of the arched rose and simple lever are sure to catch eyes on any door. Available in 7 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Classic Lever with Steeped Arched Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Full lip strike comes standard.</li>\r\n<li>28° rotation to retract latch.</li>\r\n<li>Covers 2-1/8\" bore hole.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/prodigy-installation.pdf?v=1704262303\"><b>Omnia Prodigy Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 785AR Fancy Leverset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Optional 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" or 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on one side of door. Includes 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A stationary lever for use as a pull or to match trim on both sides of door. Includes 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages\r\n privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside lever will release privacy and retract latchbolt. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 sub-roses, privacy button, tubular latch, strike plate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note: Single Dummy is Handed</b>. All other functions are non-handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Door Handing Guide</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Fluted Lever With Arched Rose, Omnia 785AR",
                "description": "Traditional Lever with Arched Rose, Omnia 785AR - Perfect for traditional homes, the Fluted Lever With Arched Rose is classic styled hardware at its best. Made by Omnia Industries, the 785AR Leverset is available in single dummy, double dummy, passage and privacy functions. Both the single dummy and the double dummy functions feature concealed surface mounting for easy installation. The passage and privacy functions are available for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and the two functions are packaged for both 1-3/8 inch or 1-3/4 inch thick doors. The beauty of the arched rose and simple lever are sure to catch eyes on any door. Available in 7 finishes.",
